  "summary": {
    "en": "On ordinary days the assistant may pay our three suppliers up to $5,000 each and $15,000 a day, and move spare cash into or out of the money-market fund. Wages need two of us to sign. When the Observatory raises Signal 8 or higher and GDACS confirms the storm, the storm plan lets it pay the 10 staff on schedule (up to $3,000 each, $25,000 a day), claim the typhoon cover, and draw up to $15,000 of the credit line per storm. Supplier payments wait until the storm passes. Nothing on any day can exceed $40,000.",
    "zh-Hant": "平日，助理可向三間供應商付款，每筆最多 5,000 元、每日最多 15,000 元，並可把多餘現金存入或取出貨幣市場基金。出糧需要我們其中兩人簽署。當天文台發出八號或以上風球、而 GDACS 確認風暴時，風暴計劃容許助理準時向 10 位員工出糧（每人最多 3,000 元、每日最多 25,000 元）、申領颱風保險，並在每次風暴提取最多 15,000 元信貸額。供應商付款會等風暴過後才處理。任何一天的總支出都不會超過 40,000 元。"
